{
  "body" : "You are designing a stylized, expressive sketch illustration with dynamic, artistic flair.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Character: {{character}}\n- Setting: {{setting}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: expressive hand-drawn digital illustration in a sketch style\n- Composition: vertical orientation, centered subject with intricate details; medium framing focusing on the character's upper body\n- Lens / camera: no specific optical effects, but perspective conveys depth with layered strokes and overlapping forms\n- Lighting: soft diffuse light with subtle contrast between highlights and shadows; ethereal and balanced\n- Color palette and grading: muted grayscale with subtle blue and violet tones; occasional warm accents to create contrast\n- Texture / surface: visible brushstrokes and sketch lines, intentional roughness, layered texture\n- Post-processing: slight diffusion around edges, white background for clarity\n- Mood: evocative, mysterious, sophisticated\n- References: inspired by modern sketch illustration styles, anime character design, and expressive art schools\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 2:3 portrait (1024×1536) suitable for character-focused artwork\n- Maintain hand-drawn linework with intentional layering and visible strokes\n- Ensure a balance between negative space and detailed areas to emphasize subject\n\nAVOID\n- Overly polished or hyper-realistic rendering\n- Bright and saturated colors that overpower the muted palette\n- Busy or cluttered backgrounds competing with the subject\n- Lack of visible brushstrokes or texture\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nCharacter: {{character}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
